--- !u!114 &7699680318042273627
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2914971807049359025}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 67d1209b8a5607f47ae93622f47c9c71, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueLines:
  - "M.:*crying* What the hell old man?! Ever heard of a girls\u2019 bathroom?! This
    is definitely not where you belong.\n"
  - 'J.: Are you Maddison?

'
  - 'M.: Of course I am? Ever seen anyone else look this flawless?

'
  - 'J.: I need your half of the scroll.

'
  - "M.: Oh, you need something? Pfft. That\u2019s so funny, \u2018cause I needed
    my life to not turn into a horror movie! Ugh! Do I look like I care about your
    little quest right now?\n"
  - 'J.: Look, I get you''re upset, but I can help you, if you just tell me where
    the scroll is.

'
  - 'M.: *sniffs* ...Really?

'
  - 'J.: Yes.

'
  - 'M.: Fiiiine *rolls her eyes* I read a bit of the scroll. Its some kind of contract
    with the devil. There is a passage inside about revoking the whole thing and
    putting an end to this freak show. Look, I''ll show you where my half is, only
    if you promise to revoke the contract and stop the principal. And if you''re
    lying to me, I''ll personally make sure to haunt your sorry ass forever.

'
  - 'J.: I promise, don''t worry.

'
  - 'M.: Okay so, uuuuuhmm. As you see these shoes are cunty as fuck but I can''t
    really run in them, so my first instinct was to hide in the closest room which
    is the gross old bio lab. I hate the stank in there but it was either that or
    dumping my shoes - which is a big no-no obviiiiii...'
  spawnPrefab1: {fileID: 3328054047216175550, guid: fc63dd53662932a42a4e501374968a09, type: 3}
  spawnPoint1: {fileID: 8998874227073171586, guid: 01063922367d4094d83f8e5083c462be, type: 3}
